/v1/","context":{"app_id":4142360,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4142360-1846018067926417","game_id":"steam-4142360","kind":"update","title":"Halloween Update","summary":"We're updating this demo for your enjoyment,CostumesWe're adding costumes in the game, depending on the season. Those costumes will update automatically following the date of the game; no need to do anything. The current costumes are Halloween, Christmas, and Chinese New Year. We're currently drawing one for Hanami. Is there any costume you want to see for Eternia? The Nurse The game is designed with the idea that you should carefully monitor your health and reload if things go dire. Since the g","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T14:56:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926417","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4142360-1845383656380094","game_id":"steam-4142360","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog October 2026","summary":"Hello everyone, Ember here!I guess the demo is pretty stable, so I didn't make an update in a while. I'll probably push one before Steam Next Fest. I'm working diligently on the game. I'd say a good half of it is done, and it was the hardest. A few months before, I was working on the laser, the second power of the game, which inflicts your ATKx3 damage in a straight line on enemies. It looks pretty cool, so enjoy this gif.Paradox Tower is made in Godot, and I made my own Magic Tower system on it","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T07:02:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656380094","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4142360-1840310314339967","game_id":"steam-4142360","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 05 August 2026","summary":"Hello Ember here, I deployed a small Patch to fix a crash when you were pressing the info key without checking a monster.I also recently added a portrait for Bubu the cat, and some fixes regarding the vampire monster ability. I did this in earlier undocumented patches.As always, if you encounter any issue, hit the Steam Forums, send us an email at hello@tsukumogami.software or join our discord .Enjoy your time in the tower,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T18:42:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314339967","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4142360-1839041357030313","game_id":"steam-4142360","kind":"announcement","title":"New Feature: The Map","summary":"We're updating this demo for your enjoyment,You can now press M on your keyboard or Y on controller to access a Map. You can also click the map button on the left part of the screen. The map reveals previously traveled areas. If you already have a save, you will need to travel to this area to have it populated in the map. With controllers and keyboard, it was not always easy telling how to escape/close the tooltip mode, where you can see monster abilities. We updated the aspect so it's obvious w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-24T17:48:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357030313","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4142360-1839041357027275","game_id":"steam-4142360","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 23/07/2026","summary":"We're updating this demo for your enjoyment,Correcting a display bug on HP lost: If a monster were to kill you, we would add an extra turn of damage. This has been removed.In the case of ATK","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-23T16:53:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357027275","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4142360-1839041357023406","game_id":"steam-4142360","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 22/07/2026","summary":"Hello! Ember here,First patch of the demo. Thanks to everyone who has been playing. We received much feedbacks, and we're addressing them.Gameplay changes:- Fixed a bug that would wrongly calculate HP when the ghost touch power was maxed and your attack would equal a monster defenseQoL changes:- Mouse-based movement speed has been doubled.- Stick Deadzone has been increased because it was reported to be too sensitive.Misc changes:- Mashing the accept during a cutscene (intro or rest) would skip ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-22T08:48:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357023406","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4142360-1838407329265128","game_id":"steam-4142360","kind":"announcement","title":"Paradox Tower Demo releases TODAY","summary":"The Demo for Paradox Tower releases today! Paradox Tower is a deterministic resource management RPG. If you know the name \"Magic Tower\", you know what I'm talking about. If you don't know it, please try it! You might get a new addiction. The game follows Eternia, the witch and Bubu the cat, across a multi-floor tower, fighting monsters, demons and witches! You carefully choose your own path and upgrades. Unwind at the hub, between expeditions and meet charming characters. Please play it and give","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-20T10:03:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329265128","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4142360-1837955055365390","game_id":"steam-4142360","kind":"announcement","title":"Paradox Tower Demo Release Date","summary":"Hello everyone, Ember here.I'm pleased to announce that we will have the demo available, translated in each promised language next week! I hope you will like it! It should take 30min to 1h to complete! It will:First level of the game with glimpse of the basicsHave the start of the storyUnlock the first powerUnlock the first shops and access to the HubLike Dice'n Goblins before, we will have a form at the end of the demo where you can make suggestions.I hope you will play it!Have fun, see you nex","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-14T07:39:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055365390","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4142360":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:49Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:49Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4142360":"2026-10-26T01:46:49Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4142360":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:49Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:49Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4142420":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:49Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:49Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_